From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local addition for suckless-tools PKGBUILD
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] tabbed 95% translucent tab backgrounds, on top of 02-alpha

The alpha patch only enables a 32-bit ARGB visual; all pixels stay
opaque, so nothing looks transparent. Force 0xf2 into the background
pixels (norm/sel/urg) so tab backgrounds composite at 95% under picom.
Text stays opaque: Xft renders glyphs from XftColor alpha, not pixel.

diff --git a/tabbed.c b/tabbed.c
index 8bb5267..61ae422 100644
--- a/tabbed.c
+++ b/tabbed.c
@@ -1157,6 +1157,12 @@ setup(void)
 	dc.urg[ColBG] = getcolor(urgbgcolor);
 	dc.urg[ColFG] = getcolor(urgfgcolor);
 
+	/* 95% opacity for tab backgrounds (0xf2, like dmenu/st); text stays
+	 * opaque since Xft renders glyphs from XftColor alpha, not pixel. */
+	dc.norm[ColBG].pixel = (dc.norm[ColBG].pixel & 0x00ffffffU) | (0xf2 << 24);
+	dc.sel[ColBG].pixel = (dc.sel[ColBG].pixel & 0x00ffffffU) | (0xf2 << 24);
+	dc.urg[ColBG].pixel = (dc.urg[ColBG].pixel & 0x00ffffffU) | (0xf2 << 24);
+
 	XSetWindowAttributes attrs;
 	attrs.background_pixel = dc.norm[ColBG].pixel;
 	attrs.border_pixel = dc.norm[ColFG].pixel;
